@startuml
title Blueprint Gate: security gate and delivery
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 120

participant "Host worker" as W #DFF3E3
participant "Model verifier\n(external tool)" as V #FFF1D6
participant "GitHub\n(external)" as GH #FFE6DB
participant "Control plane" as CP #DDEBFF
database "Decision state" as DB #E8E8FF
actor "Human reviewer" as H #DFF3E3

W -> V: Root threat-model YAML
V --> W: Verification outcome + model revision
opt Separate model PR policy enabled
  W -> GH: Model commit + pull request
end
W -> CP: Findings + verification + model revision
CP -> DB: Persist findings and design/model revisions
opt Separate model PR policy enabled
  CP -> GH: Query model PR head + review/merge state
  GH --> CP: Head, reviews, merge state
  CP -> DB: Record exact-head review result
end
H -> CP: Security approval + admin token + actor string
note over H, CP #FFF3CD
  Code records the supplied actor string; it does not
  bind that string to an authenticated human identity.
end note
CP -> DB: Record approval for current revisions
W -> CP: Claim engineering job
CP -> DB: Check verification, findings, review policy, approval
CP --> W: Engineering job + fence if gate passes
W -> GH: Push code branch + PR after local checks
CP -> GH: Query PR head + CI/review state
GH --> CP: Current head + checks + reviews
opt Auto-merge enabled; QA/security and policy checks pass
  CP -> GH: Asynchronous merge request
end
@enduml
